Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wooooo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-hoo-hoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.23,0:00:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.14,0:00:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuu-i-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.05,0:00:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuu - 걸� uno!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.97,0:00:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaaaayyanden!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.07,0:00:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.29,0:00:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.03,0:00:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.17,0:01:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My blue eyes has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.69,0:01:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.49,0:01:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my Monster Reborn magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.45,0:01:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to bring my great\Nbeast back from the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.39,0:01:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba and I make a powerful\Nteam and you two rare hunters
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.53,0:01:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,are no match for the combined\Nstrength of our decks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.77,0:01:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And when we prevail,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.31,0:01:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,you will lead us to where you are\Nholding Mokuba and the others captive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.19,0:01:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I think what my partner is trying to say\Nis that thanks to my superior skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.51,0:01:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,you're finished,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,right? Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.79,0:01:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're still stuck\Non this teamwork thing, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.25,0:01:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting a little old.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.17,0:01:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll win this duel on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.21,0:01:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it's convenient\Nfor me, I might help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.29,0:01:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't mistake that for teamwork\Nor you'll be very disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.05,0:01:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in this for Mokuba. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.11,0:01:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will do whatever it takes to defeat\Nthese rare hunters and free my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.19,0:02:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not about to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.25,0:02:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,These fools don't realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No one disrespects my family\Nand gets away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.63,0:02:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't only about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.33,0:02:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are in danger as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.29,0:02:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your problem, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.01,0:02:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dueling for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.13,0:02:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But Kaiba, you need my\Nhelp and I need yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.89,0:02:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Loomis and Umbra still\Nhave the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.11,0:02:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your partner is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.19,0:02:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have summoned your\Nblue-eyes white dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.13,0:02:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, but it's useless against the\Nultimate power of our masked beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Our camouflaged creature has 200 more\Nattack points than your pathetic dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.65,0:02:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as it attacks, your\Nblue eyes will be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.17,0:02:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's wrong, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.51,0:02:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can destroy their monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.73,0:02:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, if you want to win, you're\Ngoing to have to trust me on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.19,0:02:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Like it or not, we're a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.21,0:02:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you attack them with your blue eyes\Nwhite dragon, I promise I'll back you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.63,0:02:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.27,0:02:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some sort of trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:02:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would Yugi tell me to attack a\Nmonster that's stronger than mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.89,0:03:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell a rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.27,0:03:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack them, Kaiba! Do it! Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.49,0:03:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I will, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.89,0:03:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not in your best interest to give\Nme bad advice, because you'd lose, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.55,0:03:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my blue eyes, attack\Ntheir masked beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.77,0:03:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,White lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.77,0:03:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This better work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.65,0:03:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your masked beast is gone.\NThat's not possible. Our masked
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.09,0:03:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,beast was more powerful than\Nyour blue eyes white dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,you must have cheated he's\Nright it's a trick guess again
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.15,0:03:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,your creature was beaten by\Nkaiba's blue eyes fair and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,square please allow me to\Nexplain rare hunters when i
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.01,0:03:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,sent my beast of gilfer to\Nthe card graveyard last turn i
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.37,0:04:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,activated its special ability\Nit reduces the attack points
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.05,0:04:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,of any monster i choose by 500\Nand i chose your masked beast
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,lowering its attack points\Nto 2700 and making it weaker
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.21,0:04:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Than Kaiba's Blue Eyes. And\Nnow, in case you haven't
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.79,0:04:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,noticed you have no monsters\Non the field to protect
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.61,0:04:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,your life points So when\NKaiba attacks you again,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.55,0:04:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.59,0:04:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you need my help\Nmore than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.59,0:04:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's trying to take all the\Nglory for defeating their creature,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but it was my blue eyes that did all the\Nwork, and will win this duel thanks to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.51,0:04:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my turn is over, but\Nthis duel has only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.19,0:04:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And the next time I attack, you\Ntwo will be begging for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So go ahead and make your\Npathetic move, Loomis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.95,0:04:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no hope for you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.69,0:04:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place this monster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.77,0:05:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll place two more cards face\Ndown, and that shall end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.63,0:05:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What is his plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.09,0:05:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Once my face down cards are activated,\NKaiba's blue eyes will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.69,0:05:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my two magic mask cards\Nthat are still on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.45,0:05:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mask of the Accursed and Mask of Dispel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You lose 1,000 more life points, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So go ahead and draw a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.15,0:05:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can save you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take a chance and attack the\Nmonster he's placed in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.07,0:05:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I may defeat it, or I may force\NLoomis to use up a trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.99,0:05:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Loomis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.37,0:05:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll summon\NAlpha the Magnet Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.57,0:05:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.48,0:05:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't waste my trap\Ncard on this monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I must save it for Kaiba's blue eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He destroyed my four-faced beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.25,0:06:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to regain\Ncontrol of this duel, and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.01,0:06:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,win their Egyptian god\Ncards for Master Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.75,0:06:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have any monsters left, Loomis!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So if Kaiba attacks with his\Nblue-eyes white dragon, we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.99,0:06:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry, Umbra.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.55,0:06:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it all figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.53,0:06:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We can wipe out Kaiba's dragon right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan is guaranteed to succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.31,0:06:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.75,0:06:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Say farewell to your\Nprecious blue eyes and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.33,0:06:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,hello to the Shadow\NRealm for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.95,0:06:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way these rare hunters are\Ngoing to get away with this, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.45,0:06:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as my brother finds us,\Nthose jerks are going to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.99,0:06:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wish there was a way to get in touch\Nwith Sato and let him know where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.21,0:06:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But they took my laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.39,0:06:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we just got to wait it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.95,0:06:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, he'll track us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.25,0:07:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe there's a way for\Nyou to get to him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you've made\Nyourself at home in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.57,0:07:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.25,0:07:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's the deal with all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.13,0:07:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You caped clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.59,0:07:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll learn what we have\Nplanned for you soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.89,0:07:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,For now you are to keep quiet\Nand do what you're told to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You rare hunters think\Nyou're so tough, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.53,0:07:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Running around in your dark hoods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you untie me\Nfrom this chair and I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.85,0:07:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,show you what being a\Ntough guy's all about,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.99,0:07:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,you tattoo-faced freak of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.37,0:07:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.91,0:07:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go now and I'll go easy on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, keep your grubby\Npaws off of me, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.39,0:07:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If you touch me, you'll be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.85,0:07:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,With Joey Wheeler as my mind slave,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.19,0:07:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,little Yugi's Egyptian god\Ncard is as good as mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.79,0:07:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mokuba, this is the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.95,0:07:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.07,0:07:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I can reach now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.11,0:07:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.25,0:08:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.43,0:08:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.59,0:08:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, Taya. I'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.25,0:08:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You go and find your brother and Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.98,0:08:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Never escape me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.39,0:08:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab that little grunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya! Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about these,\Njust get some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.73,0:08:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.75,0:08:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and get the kid. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.45,0:08:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all up to Mokuba now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.85,0:08:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got to be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.31,0:08:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's split up and search the entire pier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.05,0:08:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Check every corner and inside every crate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.93,0:08:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.19,0:08:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Umbra.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:09:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's teach these fools\Na lesson, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.73,0:09:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.15,0:09:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to play Rogue Dome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.97,0:09:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.95,0:09:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that\Nyou're just a little too
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.23,0:09:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,old to be playing with\NDolly's Rare Hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.21,0:09:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially ones that have\Nsuch low attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.53,0:09:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they play such a weak monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.77,0:09:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.39,0:09:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to your blue eyes, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.05,0:09:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Rogue Doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.67,0:09:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his blue eyes white dragon now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.55,0:09:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to activate the\Ncard I have face down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mask of weakness!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.95,0:09:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.51,0:09:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your mask doing to my blue eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.85,0:09:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.19,0:09:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, as its name suggests, Kaiba, my mask\Nof weakness is weakening your blue eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.31,0:10:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, I'll play Mask of Brutality.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,which gives Rogue Dahl\N1,000 extra attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,making it stronger than your\NBlue Eyes. It's all over, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my magic card, your blue\Neye fails in comparison to my monster
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.55,0:10:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Rogue Dahl Smash Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Umbra!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's two of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.95,0:10:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'll activate this\Ntrap, Mystical Ref Paddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.27,0:10:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you forgot that\Nyou're dueling against
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,a team And that trap card just\Nsaved my teammates' blue eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.15,0:10:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to my monster's mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.95,0:10:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My Mystical Ref Paddle takes the power of
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.43,0:10:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,your magic card And\Ntransfers it to Kaiba's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Which raises its attack points by 1
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,,000 Making it stronger\Nthan your rogue doll
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.77,0:10:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes White Dragon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.45,0:11:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi helped me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.11,0:11:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My Blue-Eyes would have been destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.41,0:11:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I hate more than\Ndepending on someone else for my victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But it looks like I\Nmay need to use Yugi to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.57,0:11:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,defeat these two and\Nsave my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.21,0:11:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end, my superior deck and dueling\Nskills will be the reason we prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, rare hunters, your\Nmonster has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Loomis, look what you've just done!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.55,0:11:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, what I've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.13,0:11:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of you, I'm down to 2,000 life\Npoints, so that's what I mean. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.21,0:11:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're blaming me for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.83,0:11:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,As I recall, Rogue Doll was your monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.13,0:11:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Loomis and Umbra\Nare losing their team spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.35,0:11:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, that could cause\Nthem to lose the whole duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.47,0:11:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I keep trying to tell Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.53,0:12:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're fighting a double duel,\Nthe most important thing is teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle is far from over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your blue eyes may have\Ndefeated my monster this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.51,0:12:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have a card in my hand\Nthat will annihilate it for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.45,0:12:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If Loomis foils my plans again,\NKaiba's dragon will destroy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.77,0:12:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,so from now on, I won't\Ndepend on anyone but myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.73,0:12:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face\Ndown and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.59,0:12:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Last boarding call for Downtown Domino.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My bad, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.77,0:12:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was leaving later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.15,0:12:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.93,0:12:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.33,0:12:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, at least we made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.85,0:12:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how you feeling? I'm good. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.13,0:12:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be in Battle\NCity in no time, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.73,0:12:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.75,0:12:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.03,0:12:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you know, I'm still a little\Nnervous about taking off my bandages.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.37,0:12:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.69,0:12:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for riding the Domino Express.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.79,0:13:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have your tickets\Nready for collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.71,0:13:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be much longer now, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.53,0:13:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to finish this duel. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I am once again in total control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.75,0:13:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold my blue eyes in all its\Nfury. Prepare to lose this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Umbra, Blue Eyes, direct attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.39,0:13:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to the rest of\Nyour life points, Umbra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's making a hasty\Nmove. And a selfish one,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.55,0:13:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,too He's so caught up in winning\Nthis duel on his own He didn't even
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.13,0:13:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,think about Umbra's face down card He\Ncould be falling right into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.23,0:13:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd try that,\Nso I'll activate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.95,0:13:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mask of impregnability.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.09,0:13:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It protects me from direct\Nattacks for one turn. Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.35,0:14:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your blue-eyes barrage failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.93,0:14:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That was quite a predictable move, Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.71,0:14:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and one which I was well\Nprepared to deflect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.97,0:14:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So I have emerged untouched.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.13,0:14:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about your friend Loomis?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.87,0:14:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Loomis,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.69,0:14:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you wonder what\Nwould have happened had my
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.59,0:14:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,blue-eyes white dragon\Nattacked you instead of Umbra?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.57,0:14:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Would he have protected\Nyou with his magic card?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Or would he have let you lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.15,0:14:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the danger in depending\Non someone else to help you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.45,0:14:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,when the reality is there's\Nonly one person you can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And if anyone tells you\Notherwise, they're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.41,0:14:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.32,0:14:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.85,0:14:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I would have used\Nmy magic card to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.83,0:14:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I'm sure you wouldn't\Ndo the same thing for me, Loomis!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.17,0:14:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I get what Kaiba's trying to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He noticed that Loomis and Umbra were\Nbeginning to doubt one another's loyalty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.49,0:14:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's taking advantage of that and\Ntrying to destroy their team trust!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.65,0:14:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Kaiba's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.17,0:15:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Umbra seems to be in this for himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.27,0:15:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He probably wants to take all the credit\Nfor winning their Egyptian god cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.09,0:15:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Merrick did always like him better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.57,0:15:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll destroy these\Ntwo without his help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.19,0:15:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.31,0:15:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.49,0:15:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I really do appreciate everything\Nyou've done for me, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.87,0:15:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I would\Nhave done without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.23,0:15:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,When you updated me on Joey's duels, you\Nhelped give me the courage that I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.13,0:15:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a great time hanging out with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too, and thanks for going through all\Nthe trouble to bring me to Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.75,0:15:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else I'd rather\Nbe doing right now, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.31,0:15:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.22,0:15:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like the luckiest person in the\Nworld to have a friend as awesome as you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.95,0:15:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she say friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.49,0:15:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I'm stuck in the friend zone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.59,0:15:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.05,0:15:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.49,0:16:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to help me out of this chair\Nso we can escape from this rat hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.31,0:16:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Earth to Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.27,0:16:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody home in there? Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.53,0:16:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.99,0:16:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Joke's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.87,0:16:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're freaking me out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.35,0:16:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not Joey, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.95,0:16:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.07,0:16:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.27,0:16:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic card, Pot of Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.39,0:16:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this card, I can now draw\Ntwo new cards from my deck, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.39,0:16:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My hand doesn't look very promising,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.61,0:16:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and with no monsters on the field and\Nthe pending threat of a blue-eyes attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.31,0:16:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in no position to have weak cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.97,0:16:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I will place one card face down, and\Nthen I'll activate card exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.85,0:16:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Laying this card allows\Nme to exchange my entire
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.15,0:16:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,hand with that of any\Nother duelist on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.95,0:16:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And I choose you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.67,0:17:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Umbra, if you're not going\Nto use your cards to help,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.57,0:17:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Me. Then I'll simply take\Nthem. How dare you? All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.93,0:17:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Umbra According to the rules, we swap\Nhands So give me all of your cards now Here
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.25,0:17:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I will activate my face-down\Nmagic card Chosen one If this works,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.11,0:17:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are finished. I'll explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.03,0:17:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll place three\Ncards face down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.67,0:17:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the center of these\Nthree cards goes the chooser.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.41,0:17:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The chooser will select\None card at random.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.39,0:17:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If it chooses one of my two magic cards,\Nall three cards go to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.35,0:17:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are my cards you're risking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.71,0:17:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid they're not\Nyour cards anymore, Umbra.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.97,0:17:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If this doesn't work,\Nyou'll be sorry, Loomis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.27,0:17:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, chooser, make your selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.19,0:17:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to mention that if the\Nchooser selects my third card,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.25,0:17:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to summon an\Nall-powerful monster to the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.03,0:18:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,field without having to\Nsacrifice a weaker monster first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.37,0:18:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll both be finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.15,0:18:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If this works, I'll be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.99,0:18:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy Kaiba and Yugi on my own,\Nand Master Merrick will reward me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.57,0:18:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starting to slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.31,0:18:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's choosing a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.09,0:18:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.17,0:18:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's chosen my ultimate monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.23,0:18:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the end is near!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon the masked beast, Des Cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.43,0:18:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more powerful than\Nmy blue-eyes white dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Very observant, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.81,0:18:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Desgardias could demolish\Nyour pathetic blue-eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,white dragon with one\Nswipe of its almighty claw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.27,0:18:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky the outcome of\Nyour move was successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.65,0:19:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and now that Desgardias has been\Nunleashed, there's no stopping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.63,0:19:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My masked creature is so powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.23,0:19:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,you two pitiful duelists won't\Nstand a chance against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.69,0:19:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And when it's through with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.39,0:19:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,your blue eyes will be in\Nthe graveyard and both of
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.15,0:19:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,your Egyptian god cards will\Nbelong to Master Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.71,0:19:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.87,0:19:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to defeat their monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.77,0:19:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I may never\Nsee my friends again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.15,0:19:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can we take down\Nsomething that powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.27,0:19:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, the question is, which one\Nof you fools should I attack first?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.27,0:19:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Decisions, decisions!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.85,0:19:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I could attack you, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.65,0:19:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,With your useless Magnet\NWarriors protecting you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.41,0:19:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd wipe out the rest of your life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.63,0:19:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again, there's Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I could attack your blue eyes and rid\Nthe field of that menace for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.35,0:19:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't really matter\Nwho you attack next,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.81,0:19:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,it's only a matter of time before\Nboth of their life points reach zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.75,0:19:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and they're sent plummeting\Ninto the Shadow Realm forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.95,0:19:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.03,0:20:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So forget about rescuing your\Nfriends, they belong to Merrick now!
